@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Historial 5: POST /api/v1/supervisor/count-sessions/semaphore (Auditoría Semáforo en Patio)

actor "Auditor de Patio" as Auditor
participant "App Móvil" as App
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Semaphore Service" as Service
participant "transport_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "count_sessions DB\n(transport_order_count_sessions)" as SessionDB
participant "session_items DB\n(transport_order_count_session_items)" as SessionItemsDB
participant "truck_inventories DB" as InvDB
participant "order_histories DB\n(transport_order_histories)" as HistoryDB

== Fase 1: Muestreo Sorpresa e Inicio de Sesión Ciega ==

Auditor -> App: Selecciona camión en patio para "Auditoría Semáforo"
App -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/supervisor/transport-orders/100451/count-sessions/semaphore
Gateway -> Service: startSemaphoreSession(orderId: 100451, auditorId)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findOrderStatus(100451)
OrdersDB --> Service: orderStatus (DRIVER_INITIAL COMPLETED)

Service -> InvDB: 2. findOfficialLoadedInventories(100451)
InvDB --> Service: officialInventory[]

Service -> SessionDB: 3. insertCountSession(100451, 'SUPERVISOR_SEMAPHORE', 'IN_PROGRESS', auditorId)
SessionDB --> Service: newSessionId: 301

Service -> SessionItemsDB: 4. createBlindItemsSnapshot(301, officialInventory)
note right of SessionItemsDB
  Snapshot ciego:
  - expected_qty = loaded_qty oficial
  - item_status = 'PENDING'
  - counted_qty = NULL
end note
SessionItemsDB --> Service: ok

Service -> HistoryDB: 5. insertOrderHistory(100451, 'REV SEMAFORO', 'Inicio de auditoría semáforo en patio')
HistoryDB --> Service: ok

Service --> Gateway: 201 Created (sessionId: 301)
Gateway --> App: 201 Created
App --> Auditor: Muestra Manifiesto Ciego (sin cantidades esperadas)

== Fase 2: Registro de Conteo Producto por Producto ==

Auditor -> App: Cuenta producto (ej. 7 cajas + 9 unidades)
App -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/supervisor/count-sessions/301/items/5001/count\n{ countedBoxes: 7, countedUnits: 9 }
Gateway -> Service: recordItemCount(sessionId: 301, itemId: 5001, payload)

Service -> SessionItemsDB: 6. updateCountedAndVariance(5001, calculatedUnits)
note right of SessionItemsDB
  Calcula:
  - counted_qty = (cajas * factor) + unidades
  - variance_qty = counted_qty - expected_qty
  - item_status = (variance == 0 ? 'MATCH' : 'MISMATCH')
end note
SessionItemsDB --> Service: ok

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (itemResult: MATCH, variance: 0)
Gateway --> App: 200 OK

== Fase 3: Cierre y Certificación de Auditoría ==

Auditor -> App: Pulsa "Cerrar Auditoría Semáforo"
App -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/supervisor/count-sessions/301/close\n{ notes: "Muestra 100% conforme" }
Gateway -> Service: closeSemaphoreSession(sessionId: 301, payload)

Service -> SessionItemsDB: 7. updatePendingItemsToSkipped(301)
SessionItemsDB --> Service: ok

Service -> SessionDB: 8. updateSessionStatus(301, 'COMPLETED', completedAt=NOW())
SessionDB --> Service: ok

Service -> HistoryDB: 9. insertOrderHistory(100451, 'REV SEMAFORO', 'Auditoría semáforo completada')
HistoryDB --> Service: ok

note over InvDB, OrdersDB
  REGLAS CLAVE DE AUDITORÍA SEMÁFORO:
  1. truck_inventories NO se modifica.
  2. transport_orders.status NO cambia.
  3. No bloquea la salida del camión a ruta.
end note

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (SemaphoreSummary: { audited: 3, skipped: 19, result: 'CONFORME' })
Gateway --> App: 200 OK
App --> Auditor: Muestra resumen de conformidad de patio
@enduml
